    "## Summary & limitations\n",
    "* **Pipeline:** de-duplicate → stratified split → TF-IDF (fit on train) → MLP with BatchNorm + Dropout → AdamW + LR scheduler → early stopping with best-weight restore.\n",
    "* **Evidence:** loss/accuracy curves (section 6), test metrics, ROC and confusion matrix (section 7), and confidence scores on new messages (section 8).\n",
    "* **Baseline comparison:** TF-IDF + Logistic Regression is already very strong on this dataset; on a bag-of-words task like SMS spam, the deep model is expected to be competitive rather than dramatically better. Reporting that honestly is part of a good evaluation.\n",
